    "preamble": "State Of Gujarat vs Harsalbhai Fatabhai Chaudhary & 4 on 29 September, 2015 Author: Rajesh H.Shukla Bench: Rajesh H.Shukla R/Cr.Ma/11611/2015 Order",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "1 Further, the Hon'ble Apex Court has laid down the broad guidelines with regard to approach in such acquittal appeals including the observation made by the Hon'ble Apex Court in a judgment reported in AIR 2013 SC 274 in case of Murugesan and Ors. v. State through Inspector of Police where referring to the scope of Section 378 of Cr.PC it has been observed that if the view taken by the trial court is a possible view, it cannot be disturbed merely because the other view is possible.",
